# kb_init.py installs this as .gitattributes. The engine in scripts/ is pinned byte-for-byte (LF)
# by the CorvinOS path gate; a Windows git with core.autocrlf=true must never turn it into CRLF.
# The KB's own files are LF too: kb.py writes LF and refuses a file that mixes CRLF and LF.
* text=auto eol=lf
